        "label": "Lure the Merchant of Hommlet",
        "icon": "lure_merchant_of_hommlet",
        "description": "The Merchant is careful, and slow to trust. \n\nI can befriend them, get close, play the ignorant villager. Plant a story about a hidden treasure in a cave.\n\nThe merchant's greed will bring them to me.\n",
