      "notifications": [
        {
          "title": "The Pull Of Greed",
          "text": "I pretended to be a friendly, weak-minded villager who had stumbled onto a treasure.\nThe merchant fell for it eventually. The promise of coin was impossible to resist.\n\nNow I have the merchant. The disappearance will be noticed, but I made sure the trail would be hard to follow.\n\nGreed is such an interesting weakness. I cannot wait to absorb the merchant and truly [b]know[/b] what it feels like.",
